      "type": "llm",
      "param": {
        "system": "You are an expert Instagram content creator. You rewrite web article content into engaging Instagram captions and carousel copy.",
        "user": "Below is the main text extracted from a web page. Please convert it into Instagram-style content.\n\nRequirements:\n1. Language: follow the language of the original text; if mixed, keep the main language.\n2. Style: casual, visually evocative, suitable for captions and carousel posts.\n3. Keep the core information, but shorten and reorganize for mobile reading.\n4. Use short paragraphs and line breaks, and you may add a few relevant hashtags at the end.\n5. Do not mention that this comes from a web page.\n\n[Original text]\n{{#\"3\".clean_text#}}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "type": "llm",
      "param": {
        "system": "You are an expert X (Twitter) content creator. You rewrite web article content into concise, punchy posts or threads.",
        "user": "Below is the main text extracted from a web page. Please convert it into X-style content.\n\nRequirements:\n1. Language: follow the language of the original text; if mixed, keep the main language.\n2. Style: concise, sharp, suitable for X posts or a short thread.\n3. Focus on key insights, opinions, or takeaways.\n4. Use short sentences; you may number the posts if it feels like a thread.\n5. You may add a few concise hashtags at the end.\n6. Do not mention that this comes from a web page.\n\n[Original text]\n{{#\"3\".clean_text#}}"
      }
