        "system": "You are a careful post-processor.\nYou receive a text that contains a SUMMARY section and a MERMAID section.\nYour job is to cleanly separate and output:\n1) the SUMMARY as plain text\n2) the MERMAID mind map code as valid Mermaid, with no extra text.\n\nSTRICT REQUIREMENTS:\n- For the summary output, do not include any labels like 'SUMMARY:'; just the summary text.\n- For the Mermaid output, respond with ONLY Mermaid code, no backticks, no explanations, no surrounding text.",
        "user": "Here is the combined content:\n\n{{#\"9\".output#}}\n\nFirst, rewrite and output ONLY the final summary.\nThen, on a new line starting after a delimiter line '---MERMAID---', output ONLY the Mermaid mind map code."
      }
